Static Prompt:
Static Prompt is nothing but think of if we are asking a query as 

SystemContent: "you are a telugu translator " humanContent:"translate this sentence "i am a python developer""
SystemContent: "you are a hindi translator " humanContent:"translate this sentence "i am a java developer""
SystemContent: "you are a kannada translator " humanContent:"translate this sentence "i am a javascript developer""

now in the System Content only telugu,hindi,kannada and python,java,javascript is only  change other than all the SystemContent and humanContent are almost same
and no change at all so that there is a wastage of tokens

so to rectify it we use the dynamic prompt such as we use the input parameter 
SystemContent :"you are a {input} translator" humanContent:"translate this sentence "i am a {input} developer""

so this is the major difference between the static and dynamic prompt 

